<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mascotech said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mascotech said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Mascotech Inc to buy from outperform, a source at Smith Barney said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 17-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
